.el .ds Aq '
.TH git-mora-topic 1  "topic " 
.SH NAME
git\-mora\-topic \- Create, inspect, and update informational topic associations
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgit mora topic\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Create, inspect, and update informational topic associations
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
git\-mora\-topic\-create(1)
Create an empty topic (an existing valid topic is unchanged)
.TP
git\-mora\-topic\-list(1)
List topic ids
.TP
git\-mora\-topic\-show(1)
Show the commits associated with a topic
.TP
git\-mora\-topic\-of(1)
List topics directly containing a commit
.TP
git\-mora\-topic\-add(1)
Union commits into a topic, creating it if needed
.TP
git\-mora\-topic\-context(1)
Manage this worktree\*(Aqs future\-commit topic context
.TP
git\-mora\-topic\-exec(1)
Run a command with command\-scoped topic context
